      "q": "How much does KBR Services make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "KBR Services has $484M in federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date. KBR Services has 88 awards so far this fiscal year and an average award size of $5.5M, and obligations fell 42.9% year over year."
